      "title": "Prefix-Aware Affinity Routing",
      "items": [
        "Go Gateway hashes prompt prefixes using MD5 to produce 64-bit keys",
        "Requests route with affinity to nodes already caching the prefix",
        "Eliminates prompt prefill recomputation and minimizes TTFT"
      ]
